  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Conquerors Without Mercy" id="0f8f-fbb1-a545-d776" hidden="false">
      <description>Conquerors Without Mercy: When a model with this Traitoris Ambition fights, if it made a charge move, was charged or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, then until that fight is resolved:


Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of this model.


Improve the Armour Penetration of melee weapons this model is equipped with by 1.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Daemonic Surge" id="f20d-a242-bd62-d3cb" hidden="false">
      <description>In each of your Command phases, each model with this Traitoris Ambition can use one Daemonic Surge. If a model uses a Daemonic Surge, you must do one of the following:


Inflict 1 mortal wound on this model and roll one D3 on the table [on the model] to determine the rule that applies to this model until the start of your next Command phase.


Inflict D3 mortal wounds on this model and select one result on the table [on the model] to apply to this model until the start of your next Command phase.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
  <forceEntries>
