                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">Each time a model with this bond makes an attack, if that attack is made against a unit that was below Half-strength when this model was selected to shoot or fight, add 1 to the wound roll.</characteristic>
